  - "Tambi\xE9n est\xE1 vinculada a \xABHarry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part
    1\xBB y \xABHarry Potter and the Goblet of Fire\xBB."
  - "Los t\xEDtulos \xABHarry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2\xBB y \xABHarry
    Potter and the Goblet of Fire\xBB ofrecen las pistas m\xE1s directas."
  - "Figura cinematogr\xE1fica asociada mediante guion y direcci\xF3n a \xABHarry
    Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 2\xBB, \xABHarry Potter and the Goblet of
    Fire\xBB y \xABHarry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 1\xBB."
